mods/omarchy-tabs/main.js is adapted from Herdr's tabs mod, and
mods/omarchy-tabs/pane.js is adapted from Herdr's pane mod, shipped by
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See LICENSE-APACHE.

Changes include automatic OMP/Claude tab names, manual tab-name opt-out,
wider tab labels, optional workspace panel controls, and per-pane live
session titles with full-title tooltips. Herdr's built-in mods are unchanged.

The icons in mods/omarchy-tabs/icons/ (spinner, close, files, changes,
split-right, split-down, zoom, unzoom) are copied from Herdr's shipped
mods, under the same license.
